  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "m01-s11-l001",
      "speaker": "chief",
      "text": "Слышь, командир! Вы чё к нам пристали?! Мы тут уже сто лет живём!",
      "audio": "assets/campaign/alpha/mission01/recordings/elevenlabs/m01-s11-l001-b5757000d3f2.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "m01-s11-l002",
      "speaker": "commander",
      "text": "Какое у вас государственное образование?",
      "audio": "assets/campaign/alpha/mission01/recordings/elevenlabs/m01-s11-l002-f67cdd75de30.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "m01-s11-l003",
      "speaker": "chief",
      "text": "Чего?",
      "audio": "assets/campaign/alpha/mission01/recordings/elevenlabs/m01-s11-l003-f55b022a480d.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "m01-s11-l004",
      "speaker": "commander",
      "text": "Кто у вас главный?",
      "audio": "assets/campaign/alpha/mission01/recordings/elevenlabs/m01-s11-l004-4e300026b671.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "m01-s11-l005",
      "speaker": "chief",
      "text": "Петрович.",
      "audio": "assets/campaign/alpha/mission01/recordings/elevenlabs/m01-s11-l005-dc2761e92dbd.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "m01-s11-l006",
      "speaker": "commander",
      "text": "Должность?",
      "audio": "assets/campaign/alpha/mission01/recordings/elevenlabs/m01-s11-l006-563d746d9757.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "m01-s11-l007",
      "speaker": "chief",
      "text": "Ну… Петрович.",
      "audio": "assets/campaign/alpha/mission01/recordings/elevenlabs/m01-s11-l007-227f54bb39fa.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "m01-s11-l008",
      "speaker": "commander",
      "text": "Конституция имеется?",
      "audio": "assets/campaign/alpha/mission01/recordings/elevenlabs/m01-s11-l008-f972f8c51555.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "m01-v5-r42-l009",
      "speaker": "chief",
      "text": "А у тебя?",
      "audio": "assets/campaign/alpha/mission01/recordings/elevenlabs/m01-v5-r42-l009-90cba10f36d1.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "m01-v5-r42-l010",
      "speaker": "commander",
      "text": "У меня приказ.",
      "audio": "assets/campaign/alpha/mission01/recordings/elevenlabs/m01-v5-r42-l010-a07ed3bc68bf.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "m01-v5-r42-l011",
      "speaker": "chief",
      "text": "Вот и у меня. Только я сам отдаю.",
      "audio": "assets/campaign/alpha/mission01/recordings/elevenlabs/m01-v5-r42-l011-f7c11885572a.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "m01-v5-r42-l012",
      "speaker": "commander",
      "text": "Прикажи себе сдаться. Заодно дисциплину проверим.",
      "audio": "assets/campaign/alpha/mission01/recordings/elevenlabs/m01-v5-r42-l012-8fe62faa07e4.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "m01-v5-r42-l013",
      "speaker": "chief",
      "text": "Да ты сначала зайди сюда!",
      "audio": "assets/campaign/alpha/mission01/recordings/elevenlabs/m01-v5-r42-l013-76aac33a7283.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "m01-v5-r42-l014",
      "speaker": "commander",
      "text": "Слышали, ребята? Нас пригласили. Заходим.",
      "audio": "assets/campaign/alpha/mission01/recordings/elevenlabs/m01-v5-r42-l014-c41e47f01629.mp3"
    }
  ],
